    "## Embedding Strategy\n",
    "To preserve high-level topology in the t-SNE visualisation we run PAGA on the Harmony-corrected PCA space. For each cluster k with centroid position c_k we sample initial coordinates for cell i as x_i^0 ~ N(c_k, \n",
    "\tsigma^2 I). The t-SNE optimisation then refines these starting points while respecting the PAGA connectivity."
