    "## Differential Expression Testing\n",
    "Differentially expressed genes are identified with the Wilcoxon rank-sum test as implemented in `scanpy.tl.rank_genes_groups`. For each gene g the log fold change is computed as\\n\\n$$\\mathrm{logFC}_g = \\log\\_2\biggl(\f",
    "rac{\bar{x}\\_{g,\text{group}}+\\epsilon}{\bar{x}\\_{g,\text{rest}}+\\epsilon}\biggr)$$\\n\\nwhere $\bar{x}\\_{g,\text{group}}$ and $\bar{x}\\_{g,\text{rest}}$ denote the mean normalised expression in the target and reference populations. Genes surpassing the specified log fold change and fraction of expressing cells are retained."
